  "name": "Example: Adding a Negative Decimal",
  "problem": "What is the value of $-1 + (- 2.5)?$",
  "worked_solution": "First, we drop the parentheses and the addition sign, which gives\n\n$$\n-1 + (- 2.5) = -1 - 2.5.\n$$\n\nThen, we carry out the subtraction as usual. This gives\n\n$$\n-1 - 2.5 = -3.5.\n$$",
